{"publicId":"4fd2678c-8adc-4348-afe6-b4eb578e852d","title":"MoofTCP为68k Mac提供现代TCP/IP替代方案，但存在多项限制","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-06T00:54:15.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-06T00:54:15.000Z","digest":"开发者通过GitHub发布MoofTCP项目，旨在为运行System 6的68k Mac提供现代TCP/IP协议栈替代方案，兼容原版接口并优化性能。该方案仅支持IPv4，实测仅与DaynaPORT Ethernet驱动器在System 6.0.8版本上通过，且存在UDP 68端口不可用、无DHCP服务器时连接延迟10秒后失败等限制。构建需使用Docker，目前未提及IPv6支持或跨驱动兼容性进展。\n\n项目通过重新编写C语言底层协议栈实现，内存占用与原版MacTCP相同，附带独立控制面板和安装程序。尽管标榜为‘现代替代方案’，但实际测试范围和功能完善度仍存疑问，需结合具体硬件环境评估适用性。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-06T02:16:28.802Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"MoofTCP – 68k Macs 上 MacTCP 的现代替代方案","latestReport":{"id":"d5ekhe85h1m7d0grv7qjplevx"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fMJiSwEH5V-M","title":"MoofTCP – A modern replacement for MacTCP on 68k Macs","firstReportAt":"2026-11-06T00:54:15.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"d5ekhe85h1m7d0grv7qjplevx","title":"MoofTCP – 68k Macs 上 MacTCP 的现代替代方案","summary":"MoofTCP 是一个为 68k Macs 上的 System 6 设计的现代 TCP/IP 替代方案，旨在提高可靠性、低延迟和吞吐量，同时占用与 MacTCP 相同的内存。它兼容 MacTCP 接口，支持 DHCP 或固定 IP 地址，并提供 Lite 版本以节省内存。该项目已在 Mac Classic 上测试通过，并支持 BlueSCSI 等网络硬件。","source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-06T00:54:15.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"d5ekhe85h1m7d0grv7qjplevx","title":"MoofTCP – 68k Macs 上 MacTCP 的现代替代方案","summary":"MoofTCP 是一个为 68k Macs 上的 System 6 设计的现代 TCP/IP 替代方案，旨在提高可靠性、低延迟和吞吐量，同时占用与 MacTCP 相同的内存。它兼容 MacTCP 接口，支持 DHCP 或固定 IP 地址，并提供 Lite 版本以节省内存。该项目已在 Mac Classic 上测试通过，并支持 BlueSCSI 等网络硬件。","source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-06T00:54:15.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-06T03:00:00.000Z","heat":9.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T07:00:00.000Z","heat":8.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T08:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"pa